      "refersTo": "material-card",
      "description": "Square surface with family-local name.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-material\" aria-label=\"Select color.brand.200\"><span class=\"ds-color\"></span><span>200</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-material{width:112px;padding:3px;border:0;border-radius:10px;display:grid;gap:3px;text-align:left;color:var(--ink,#202020);background:transparent;font:500 12px var(--font-ui,Geist,sans-serif)}.ds-color{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:7px;background:var(--brand,#a3ff47)}.ds-material:hover{background:var(--surface-hover,#e8e8e8)}.ds-material:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#43830c);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Glass dropdown",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "select",
      "description": "Frosted listbox material; full keyboard behavior lives in Select.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-menu\" role=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"Token type\"><div class=\"ds-option\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\">Color</div><div class=\"ds-option\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\">Dimension</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-menu{width:160px;padding:4px;border:1px solid var(--line,#d2d2d2);border-radius:10px;background:var(--glass-raised,rgb(255 255 255 /74%));color:var(--ink,#202020);backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(1.08);box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgb(0 0 0 /.24);font:450 12px/18px var(--font-ui,Geist,sans-serif)}.ds-option{min-height:32px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px}.ds-option:hover{background:var(--surface-hover,#e8e8e8)}.ds-option:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#43830c);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Contextual add",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "section-add",
      "description": "Family-owned creation action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-add\" aria-label=\"Add token to color.brand\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 4v12M4 10h12\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-add{display:grid;place-items:center;width:24px;height:24px;padding:5px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:var(--surface-subtle,#f2f2f2);color:var(--ink,#202020)}.ds-add:hover{background:var(--surface-active,#dedede)}.ds-add:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#43830c);outline-offset:3px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Compact glass workbench",
    "overview": "Axiom UI is a compact glass workbench. Achromatic planes recede behind the authored materials; fluorescent green identifies action. Geist, thin rounded SVG icons and tightly grouped controls give English and Korean authoring a consistent rhythm.\n\nTranslucent headers, rails, inspectors and overlapping menus share neutral edge light and soft backdrop diffusion. Both themes retain the same hierarchy. Studio appearance stays independent from the user's authored colors, typography and saved theme preferences.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Achromatic grounds with a fluorescent action accent.",
      "Compact controls and aligned panel bars.",
      "Material specimens with contextual creation and inspection.",
      "Shared glass depth in dark and light appearances."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Independent Values",
        "body": "Studio appearance never rewrites authored token values or saved appearance preferences.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "One Selected Surface",
        "body": "Use a neutral fill for selected specimens and segmented choices; preserve a distinct keyboard focus outline.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Shared Glass",
        "body": "Use translucent structural planes and frosted raised surfaces with restrained neutral edge light; reduced transparency restores solid surfaces.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** reuse semantic roles and shared primitives.",
      "**Do** keep related measurements together and disclose advanced metadata.",
      "**Do** preserve readable focus, Korean input composition, reduced motion and reviewed source changes.",
      "**Do** inspect selector precedence when extending a control."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** tint neutral Studio surfaces with the accent.",
      "**Don't** repeat the full token path beneath a family heading.",
      "**Don't** add competing selection borders to filled specimen or view controls.",
      "**Don't** treat static captures or source generation as proof of motion quality, native execution or Foundation completion."
    ]
  }
}
